[{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0309","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0309.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-14847","title":"MikroTik RouterOS WinBox 目录遍历漏洞","description":"MikroTik RouterOS 6.42 及之前版本的 WinBox 管理接口存在目录遍历漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标设备的 TCP 8291 端口（WinBox 服务默认端口）发送特制的请求包，利用路径遍历绕过身份验证，实现任意文件读取，包括系统密码文件、配置文件和用户数据库等敏感信息。已认证的远程攻击者还可利用该漏洞写入任意文件，进而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响所有运行 RouterOS 6.42 及更早版本的路由器设备，无需任何用户交互即可触发，危害严重。MikroTik 已在 RouterOS 6.43rc3 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-14847"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-08-02T07:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:41:44Z","remediation":"升级 MikroTik RouterOS 至 6.43rc3 或更高版本（Long-term 升级至 6.42.1 及以上）。通过 WinBox 或 Web 界面在 System → Software 中检查更新并安装。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙规则中限制对 8291 端口（WinBox 服务）的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/BasuCert/WinboxPoC","https://github.com/BigNerd95/WinboxExploit","https://github.com/tenable/routeros/blob/master/bug_hunting_in_routeros_derbycon_2018.pdf","https://github.com/tenable/routeros/tree/master/poc/bytheway","https://github.com/tenable/routeros/tree/master/poc/cve_2018_14847","https://mikrotik.com/supportsec/winbox-vulnerability","https://n0p.me/winbox-bug-dissection/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45578/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-14847","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45578","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-14847.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/d08f837f771e6cd83ec9c845b0c4f72f125cbe84/2018/CVE-2018-14847.md","https://github.com/k8gege/LadonGo/blob/d364895fb459d99bda242166e5305f23c387754f/exp/CVE-2018-14847.go","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/78f6b1731532530a1ff639ea0b08b84d975b4e39/data/by-cve/CVE-2018-14847.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/5fe4fb06582cbbd39c10cfbc884045e215a69cb5/2018/CVE-2018-14847.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/78f6b1731532530a1ff639ea0b08b84d975b4e39/data/2018/CVE-2018-14847-BasuCert_WinboxPoC.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/78f6b1731532530a1ff639ea0b08b84d975b4e39/data/2018/CVE-2018-14847-Tr33-He11_winboxPOC.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/78f6b1731532530a1ff639ea0b08b84d975b4e39/data/2018/CVE-2018-14847-syrex1013_MikroRoot.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-14847.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/78f6b1731532530a1ff639ea0b08b84d975b4e39/data/2018/CVE-2018-14847-jas502n_CVE-2018-14847.md","https://github.com/hacker30468/Mikrotik-router-hack","https://github.com/jas502n/CVE-2018-14847","https://github.com/sinichi449/Python-MikrotikLoginExploit","https://github.com/syrex1013/MikroRoot"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0309.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0084","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0084.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-14474","title":"Orange Forum 开放重定向漏洞","description":"Orange Forum 1.4.0 存在开放重定向漏洞，位于 views/auth.go 文件中。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 /login 或 /signup 页面的 next 参数中注入恶意 URL，诱使用户点击特制链接后自动跳转到外部恶意站点，导致钓鱼攻击或用户信任被滥用。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危，攻击复杂度低，无需特权，但需要用户交互。厂商已在 GitHub 提交 1f6313c 中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-14474"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-07-20T18:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:41:05Z","remediation":"立即升级 Orange Forum 至包含 commit 1f6313cb 的修复版本（≥1.4.1），该提交在 views/auth.go 中对 next 参数进行了 URL 白名单校验，阻止跳转到外部域名。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层（Nginx/HAProxy）添加规则，仅允许 next 参数为相对路径或本站域名，拒绝包含 http/https 协议头的重定向请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/s-gv/orangeforum/commit/1f6313cb3a1e755880fc1354f3e1efc4dd2dd4aa","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-14474.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-14474.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/38e315e25498e9628d3adfa5823d07fd5ba15a1d/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-14474.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-14474.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-14474-3303.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-14474-3302.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/Open Redirect/CVE-2018-14474.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2018/14xxx/CVE-2018-14474.json","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2018/CVE-2018-14474.yaml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/d8cd4a1ae21f91a5e3337a6b189b078a1a73a4aa/plugins/goodoldweb/orange_forum/CVE-2018-14474.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-14474.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0084.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-1000","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-1000.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-7602","title":"Drupal 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Drupal 7.x 和 8.x 核心存在远程代码执行漏洞（CVE-2018-7602，又称 Drupalgeddon3），由于表单渲染过程中对用户输入校验不严，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标站点发送特制的 HTTP 请求，利用多个攻击向量触发该漏洞，在无需登录的情况下实现远程代码执行，完全控制目标服务器。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重，影响所有 Drupal 7.58 以下及 8.5.1 以下版本，且已在野外被大规模利用。官方已发布安全更新修复此漏洞，建议立即升级至 Drupal 7.58 或 8.5.1 及以上版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-7602"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-07-19T17:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:03:26Z","remediation":"立即升级 Drupal 至安全版本：Drupal 7.x 升级至 7.59，Drupal 8.4.x 升级至 8.4.8，Drupal 8.5.x 升级至 8.5.3。如无法立即升级，可先应用 SA-CORE-2018-002（CVE-2018-7600）的补丁，再应用 CVE-2018-7602 的官方补丁（Drupal 8.x 补丁：https://git.drupalcode.org/project/drupal/commit/bb6d396609600d1169da29456ba3db59abae4b7e.diff；Drupal 7.x 补丁：https://git.drupalcode.org/project/drupal/commit/080daa38f265ea28444c540832509a48861587d0.diff）。同时检查站点是否已被入侵，若发现异常立即排查并恢复备份。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103985","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1040754","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2018/04/msg00030.html","https://www.debian.org/security/2018/dsa-4180","https://www.drupal.org/sa-core-2018-004","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44542/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44557/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-7602","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44542","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7602.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-7602.md","https://github.com/zhzyker/exphub/blob/946405b3447dbaf2a5eb49e2f56ec33fe1165e49/drupal/cve-2018-7602_poc.py","https://github.com/zhzyker/exphub/blob/946405b3447dbaf2a5eb49e2f56ec33fe1165e49/drupal/cve-2018-7602_cmd.py","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/ab6f9d01ebd789d88d6c9c80d2c4801a89e1f38f/2018/CVE-2018-7602.json","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/CMS漏洞/Drupal 远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2018-7602.md","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/web/drupal/CVE-2018-7602.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Vulnerability-Wiki/blob/b32b83c01eabac4d6b4b334852be9cff76ba67ee/docs-base/docs/cms/Drupal-远程代码执行漏洞-CVE-2018-7602.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-7602/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2018-7602.py","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-7602/vultarget/drupa7-CVE-2018-7602.py","https://github.com/cckuailong/pocsploit/blob/fe4a3154e59d2bebd55ccfdf62f4f7efb21b5a2a/modules/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7602.py","https://github.com/CLincat/vulcat","https://github.com/1337g/Drupalgedon3","https://github.com/shellord/Drupalgeddon-Mass-Exploiter","https://github.com/kastellanos/CVE-2018-7602","https://github.com/cyberharsh/DrupalCVE-2018-7602"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-1000.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-1000.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0210","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0210.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-8011","title":"Apache HTTP Server mod_md 空指针解引用拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 2.4.33 版本中 mod_md 模块的挑战处理程序存在空指针解引用漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标服务器发送特制的 HTTP 请求，触发 mod_md 在处理 ACME 挑战时解引用空指针，导致 httpd 子进程因段错误崩溃，造成服务拒绝（DoS）。该漏洞仅影响 Apache HTTP Server 2.4.33 版本，已在 2.4.34 版本中修复，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-8011"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-07-18T14:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:04:04Z","remediation":"升级 Apache HTTP Server 至 2.4.34 或更高版本。如使用 Red Hat/CentOS，运行 `yum update httpd`；Debian/Ubuntu 运行 `apt-get update && apt-get upgrade apache2`。若无法立即升级，在 httpd.conf 中注释或移除 `LoadModule md_module modules/mod_md.so` 以禁用 mod_md 模块，重启 httpd 服务后生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1041401","https://httpd.apache.org/security/vulnerabilities_24.html#CVE-2018-8011","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/56c2e7cc9deb1c12a843d0dc251ea7fd3e7e80293cde02fcd65286ba%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/84a3714f0878781f6ed84473d1a503d2cc382277e100450209231830%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r03