8-8011.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2018-8011.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/javascript/cves/2018/CVE-2018-8011.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2018-8011.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-8011.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2018-8011"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0210.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0175","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0175.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-2894","title":"Oracle WebLogic Server WLS Web Services 任意文件上传漏洞","description":"Oracle WebLogic Server 的 WLS Web Services 组件（ws_utc）存在任意文件上传漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过 HTTP 协议访问 ws_utc 应用，利用其未对上传文件类型进行有效校验的缺陷，向服务器上传恶意 JSP 文件，从而获取服务器控制权。该漏洞影响 WebLogic Server 12.1.3.0、12.2.1.2 及 12.2.1.3 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击无需任何权限，利用复杂度低，可导致机密性、完整性和可用性完全丧失。Oracle 已在 2018 年 7 月关键补丁更新中修复此漏洞，建议升级至最新版本或禁用 ws_utc 应用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-2894"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-07-18T13:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:56:34Z","remediation":"升级 Oracle WebLogic Server 至 12.1.3.0.20180717 及以上补丁集，或 12.2.1.2.20180717、12.2.1.3.20180717 及以上版本。如无法升级，删除 `ws_utc/config.do` 和 `ws_utc/begin.do` 接口或限制 `/ws_utc/` 路径的访问权限，仅允许受信 IP 访问 Web 管理控制台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/security-advisory/cpujul2018-4258247.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/104763","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1041301","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-2894.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-2894.md","https://github.com/zhzyker/exphub/blob/946405b3447dbaf2a5eb49e2f56ec33fe1165e49/weblogic/cve-2018-2894_poc_exp.py","https://github.com/fofapro/vulfocus/blob/4b7a2eaacce4ed770f289e6e72f7240da1e16c74/writeup/CVE-2018-2894/CVE-2018-2894.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/0cbbfd20018b392e9b69a82c4ac1297203bfeefd/2018/CVE-2018-2894.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c908bbff86d2944f8f8a39e75f549a966c642420/2018/CVE-2018-2894.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2018-2894.yaml","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/中间件漏洞/Weblogic 任意文件上传漏洞 CVE-2018-2894.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-2894-3526.yaml","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/weblogic/CVE-2018-2894.md","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-2894.yaml","https://github.com/0xn0ne/weblogicScanner","https://github.com/LandGrey/CVE-2018-2894","https://github.com/k8gege/PyLadon","https://github.com/jas502n/CVE-2018-2894","https://github.com/111ddea/cve-2018-2894"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0175.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0174","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0174.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-2893","title":"Oracle WebLogic Server WLS Core 组件远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Oracle Fusion Middleware 的 Oracle WebLogic Server 组件 WLS Core 子组件存在远程代码执行漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过 T3 协议向受影响的 WebLogic Server 发送特制的序列化数据包触发该漏洞，成功利用可完全接管目标 WebLogic Server 服务器，导致机密性、完整性和可用性全部丧失。该漏洞影响 WebLogic Server 10.3.6.0、12.1.3.0、12.2.1.2 及 12.2.1.3 版本，无需任何权限即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。Oracle 已在 2018 年 7 月季度关键补丁更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-2893"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-07-18T13:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:56:34Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Oracle 2018 年 7 月关键补丁更新（Critical Patch Update），通过 Oracle 支持门户下载对应版本的 WebLogic Server 补丁。受影响版本包括 10.3.6.0、12.1.3.0、12.2.1.2 和 12.2.1.3。如无法立即打补丁，可在防火墙或网络层面阻止 T3 协议流量进入 WebLogic Server 端口（默认为 7001），作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/security-advisory/cpujul2018-4258247.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/104763","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1041301","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/network/cves/2018/CVE-2018-2893.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-2893.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/0cbbfd20018b392e9b69a82c4ac1297203bfeefd/2018/CVE-2018-2893.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c908bbff86d2944f8f8a39e75f549a966c642420/2018/CVE-2018-2893.json","https://github.com/zhzyker/exphub/blob/946405b3447dbaf2a5eb49e2f56ec33fe1165e49/weblogic/cve-2018-2893_cmd.py","https://github.com/zhzyker/exphub/blob/946405b3447dbaf2a5eb49e2f56ec33fe1165e49/weblogic/cve-2018-2893_poc.py","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/weblogic/CVE-2018-2893.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2018-2893.yaml","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/network/cves/2018/CVE-2018-2893.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-2893-3523.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-2893-3525.yaml","https://github.com/0xn0ne/weblogicScanner","https://github.com/pyn3rd/CVE-2018-2893","https://github.com/shengqi158/CVE-2018-2628","https://github.com/qianl0ng/CVE-2018-2893","https://github.com/bigsizeme/CVE-2018-2893"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0174.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0081","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0081.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-13980","title":"Zeta Producer Desktop CMS 本地文件泄露漏洞","description":"Zeta Producer Desktop CMS 14.2.1 之前版本中内置的 filebrowser 插件存在目录遍历漏洞，位于 assets/php/filebrowser/filebrowser.main.php 文件。攻击者可通过在 file 参数中注入 ../ 序列实现路径穿越，在无需身份认证的情况下读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞需目标站点已安装并启用 filebrowser 插件方可利用，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-13980"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-07-16T14:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:40:25Z","remediation":"升级 Zeta Producer Desktop CMS 至 14.2.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 assets/php/filebrowser/filebrowser.main.php 中的目录遍历漏洞。如无法立即升级，可删除或重命名 filebrowser 插件目录（assets/php/filebrowser/）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/148537/Zeta-Producer-Desktop-CMS-14.2.0-Code-Execution-File-Disclosure.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45016/","https://www.sec-consult.com/en/blog/advisories/remote-code-execution-local-file-disclosure-zeta-producer-desktop-cms/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-13980.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-13980.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/38e315e25498e9628d3adfa5823d07fd5ba15a1d/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-13980.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-13980.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-13980-3292.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-13980-3294.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-13980-3295.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-13980-3291.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Zeta Producer Desktop CMS/CVE-2018-13980.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-13980.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2018-13980.js"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0081.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0083","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0083.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-14064","title":"VelotiSmart WiFi B-380 摄像头目录遍历漏洞","description":"VelotiSmart WiFi B-380 摄像头固件中的 uc-http 服务 1.0.0 存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 TCP 80 端口发送特制的 HTTP 请求（如 /../../etc/passwd）读取设备任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重，影响所有运行该固件版本的 VelotiSmart B-380 摄像头设备。攻击者可直接利用公开的 Exploit-DB 编号 45030 的 PoC 进行利用，无需任何前置条件。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-14064"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-07-15T15:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:40:35Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响 VelotiSmart WiFi B-380 摄像头，厂商已无安全更新支持。建议立即停止使用该设备并更换为受支持的替代产品；如无法更换，须在防火墙上限制 TCP 80 端口仅允许受信任内网 IP 访问，同时将设备置于独立 VLAN 中隔离，避免暴露在公网。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://medium.com/%40s1kr10s/velotismart-0day-ca5056bcdcac","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45030/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45030","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-14064.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-14064.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/38e315e25498e9628d3adfa5823d07fd5ba15a1d/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-14064.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2018-14064.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-14064-3301.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-14064-3299.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/VelotiSmart/CVE-2018-14064.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2018/14xxx/CVE-2018-14064.json","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2018-14064.js","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2018/CVE-2018-14064.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-14064.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0083.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0211","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0211.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-8024","title":"Apache Spark URL 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Apache Spark 2.1.0至2.1.2、2.2.0至2.2.1以及2.3.0版本中存在反射型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。恶意攻击者可构造指向Spark集群Web UI的作业和阶段信息页面的特制URL，诱使用户访问后，可在用户浏览器中执行任意JavaScript脚本，窃取用户视角下的Spark UI敏感信息。虽然Chrome和Safari等现代浏览器可拦截此类攻击，但Firefox等浏览器无法有效防御。攻击者需具备低权限且依赖用户交互，CVSS评分5.4，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2018-8024"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-07-12T13:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:04:06Z","remediation":"2.1.x 用户升级至 Apache Spark 2.1.3 或更高版本，2.2.x 用户升级至 2.2.2 或更高版本，2.3.x 用户升级至 2.3.1 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理或 WAF 层面过滤包含恶意脚本参数的 Spark UI 请求 URL，并限制 Spark UI 仅对内网可信网络开放，避免暴露到公网。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/5f241d2cda21cbcb3b63e46e474cf5f50cce66927f08399f4fab0aba%40%3Cdev.spark.apache.org%3E","https://spark.apache.org/security.html#CVE-2018-8024","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-8024.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-8024.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-8024.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2018/8xxx/CVE-2018-8024.json","https://github.com/RhinoSecurityLabs/CVEs/blob/0542b712a86502541a2499e588796704f30a0e5f/CVE-2018-8024/README.md","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/5784554659c9500df8525e8db4f986630a56d8a1/plugins/apache/spark/CVE-2018-8024.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-8024.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-8024.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/GHSA/data/2018/CVE-2018-8024.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/753d2e0d725b348a212e8863d776d632b54550eb/data/2018/CVE-2018-8024.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-8024.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0211.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-1100","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-1100.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-8298","title":"Microsoft ChakraCore 脚本引擎远程代码执行漏洞","description":"ChakraCore 脚本引擎在处理内存对象时存在类型混淆漏洞。攻击者可以通过精心构造的 JavaScript 代码，在 JIT（即时编译）优化过程中触发 InitializeNumberFormat 或 InitializeDateTimeFormat 函数的类型推断错误，导致内存损坏。当受害者通过浏览器访问恶意网页时，攻击者可利用此漏洞实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响使用 ChakraCore 的产品（如早期 Microsoft Edge），攻击条件为用户交互且需执行特定脚本，CVSS 评分为 7.5，危害等级为高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-8298"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-07-11T00:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:04:35Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Microsoft Edge 或 Internet Explorer 浏览器更新至 2018 年 7 月的安全补丁版本。具体操作为通过 Windows Update 检查并安装最新的累积更新，或手动下载并安装对应的 KB 安全更新包以修复 ChakraCore 引擎的内存损坏漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/104639","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2018-8298","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45217/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-8298","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45217","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-8298.md","https://github.com/tunz/js-vuln-db/blob/26d3f06008cbf95d05f066d2bf2a220deff491fc/chakra/CVE-2018-8298.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9aee4694c57e6f549d7f2ae075baefe98f4ec05f/2018/8xxx/CVE-2018-8298.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-8298.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-8288.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-8291.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-8242.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/39cf4547de2e266ceb8827aa7ae993ba929a25b6/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-8298.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/39cf4547de2e266ceb8827aa7ae993ba929a25b6/GHSA/data/2018/CVE-2018-8298.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-8298.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-1100.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-1100.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-1100.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0806","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0806.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-5002","title":"Adobe Flash Player 栈缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 29.0.0.171 及更早版本（30.0.0.113 之前版本）存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-787, CWE-121）。该漏洞源于 Flash Player 在处理特定恶意构造的 Flash 内容时，未正确验证栈缓冲区边界，导致攻击者可通过诱导用户访问包含恶意 Flash 内容的网页或打开恶意文件，触发栈缓冲区溢出，进而在当前用户权限上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows、macOS、Linux 等平台上的 Adobe Flash Player，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.8（HIGH），攻击向量为本地（AV:L），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），无需权限（PR:N），但需要用户交互（UI:R），成功利用可导致机密性、完整性、可用性均受到高影响（C:H/I:H/A:H）。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录，Adobe 已于 2018 年 6 月发布 30.0.0.113 版本修复此漏洞，用户应尽快升级至最新版本或卸载 Flash Player。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-5002"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-07-09T19:29:03Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:59:26Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Adobe Flash Player 到 32.0.0.393 或更高版本，这是支持所有安全补丁的最新版本。如无法立即升级，可先通过全局策略禁用 Flash 插件。确保Windows Defender或杀毒软件开启漏洞防护，并监控系统对可疑flash进程的网络活动。此外，强烈建议彻底停用Flash功能，改用现代Web技术（HTML5/WebGL）以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/104412","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1041058","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2018:1827","https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/flash-player/apsb18-19.html","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201806-02","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/issues/196","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-5002","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-5002.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f625935bbdd0ae4ac139d59ec61616511fa07861/2018/5xxx/CVE-2018-5002.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-5002.md","https://github.com/stamparm/maltrail/blob/81ec9b6ee19e58a1775566da070ad4e6387059bb/trails/static/malware/chainshot.txt","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-5002.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c5b23a2286aa84c456bf6f6d110b03c6adf1961/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-5002.json","https://github.com/eyalmazuz/ThreatIntelligenceCorpus/blob/c47f9d2b7ba92e0cbba71c67b938a49e055c5cdc/Corpus/morphisec_flash-vulnerability-cve-2018-5002.txt","https://github.com/eyalmazuz/ThreatIntelligenceCorpus/blob/c47f9d2b7ba92e0cbba71c67b938a49e055c5cdc/Corpus/securityaffairs_cve-2018-5002-zero-day.html.txt","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/f52824ab85b4a56207060d8a0fb7319df7a49552/vex/cve/2018/CVE-2018-5002.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2018/CVE-2018-5002"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0806.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0800","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0800.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-4990","title":"Adobe Acrobat Reader 双重释放漏洞 漏洞","description":"CVE-2018-4990是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-4990"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-07-09T19:29:03Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:59:25Z","remediation":"升级 Adobe Acrobat Reader 至以下修复版本：Acrobat Reader DC Continuous 更新至 2018.011.20063，Acrobat Reader 2017 更新至 2017.011.30102，Acrobat Reader 2015 更新至 2015.006.30452。更新方式：打开 Acrobat Reader，点击「帮助」→「检查更新」，或从 Adobe 官方下载中心（https://get.adobe.com/reader/）下载完整安装包重新安装。如无法立即升级，可在 Acrobat Reader 中禁用 JavaScript（编辑→首选项→JavaScript→取消勾选「启用 Acrobat JavaScript」）作为临时缓解措施，以阻止利用脚本执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/104167","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1040920","https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/acrobat/apsb18-09.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-4990","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-4990.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1151be698e64b51eb19177cd83dc80ba0e7322d2/2018/4xxx/CVE-2018-4990.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-4990.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-4990.md","https://github.com/kujian/frontendDaily/blob/0c55925cecdd4127cb47948a06d34f2a1ccf4595/2018/05/26.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c6571763508e950910be0b6238faf54b18800390/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-4990.json","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2018/CVE-2018-4990.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c6571763508e950910be0b6238faf54b18800390/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-4990.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2018/CVE-2018-4990","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-4990.rules"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0800.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0205","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0205.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-7765","title":"Schneider Electric U.motion Builder SQL注入漏洞","description":"施耐德电气 U.motion Builder 软件 1.3.4 之前版本中的 track_import_export.php 文件存在 SQL 注入漏洞。由于程序未对 object_id 输入参数进行充分的过滤和转义，导致攻击者可构造恶意 SQL 查询语句注入底层 SQLite 数据库。远程攻击者可通过诱使用户访问特制链接触发该漏洞，从而实现对数据库的未授权读取、修改或删除操作，造成敏感信息泄露或数据完整性破坏。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-7765"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-07-03T14:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:03:41Z","remediation":"升级至 U.motion Builder v1.3.4 或更高版本，该版本修复了 track_import_export.php 中 object_id 参数的 SQL 注入问题。注意该产品已退役，建议迁移至替代方案。临时缓解措施：在防火墙或反向代理层面限制对 /smartdomuspad/modules/reporting/track_import_export.php 路径的访问，仅允许受信 IP 访问管理界面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2019/May/26","https://www.schneider-electric.com/en/download/document/SEVD-2018-095-01/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7765.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-7765.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7765.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2018/7xxx/CVE-2018-7765.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-7765.md","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/5784554659c9500df8525e8db4f986630a56d8a1/plugins/schneider-electric/u.motion_builder/CVE-2018-7765.yaml","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-7765.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-7765.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-7765.rules","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7765.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2018-7765.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0205.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0205.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-1206","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-1206.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-9276","title":"Paessler PRTG Network Monitor 命令注入漏洞","description":"PRTG Network Monitor 在 18.2.39 版本之前存在 OS 命令注入漏洞。该漏洞源于传感器或通知管理场景中对用户输入参数的过滤不严，允许拥有系统管理员权限的攻击者通过发送恶意构造的参数，在 PRTG 服务器及其监控的设备上执行任意操作系统命令。攻击者需具备管理员权限才能触发此漏洞，成功利用后可实现远程代码执行（RCE），导致系统被完全控制。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2018-9276"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-07-02T16:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:06:20Z","remediation":"建议立即将 PRTG Network Monitor 升级至 18.2.39 或更高版本，以修复 OS 命令注入漏洞。在更新完成前，应严格限制 PRTG 系统管理员 Web 控制台的访问权限，仅允许可信的管理员账户登录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/148334/PRTG-Command-Injection.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/161183/PRTG-Network-Monitor-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/542103/100/0/threaded","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46527/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-9276","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46527","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2018/CVE-2018-9276.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/835d8d6f094bfed962218970c570dc154a6a9b5c/2018/CVE-2018-9276.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/d808dcfadcd0a0911218bbebd828dbae55c16a3e/2018/CVE-2018-9276.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2018/9xxx/CVE-2018-9276.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/8aa3fb6edbc01998fa6469125b06f34b431f0aea/2018/9xxx/CVE-2018-9276.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2018/CVE-2018-19410.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/3467f0f0d2759ed7c99ae98d12f098b08f226acf/2018/CVE-2018-9276.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-9276.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-9276.md","https://github.com/madneal/htb/blob/8d2df6a42958c37303ecd65287daa2b59b611a7e/Netmon/CVE-2018-9276.py","https://github.com/wildkindcc/CVE-2018-9276","https://github.com/alvinsmith-eroad/CVE-2018-9276","https://github.com/AC8999/PRTG-Network-Monitor-18.2.38---Authenticated-Remote-Code-Execution-CVE-2018-9276","https://github.com/andyfeili/CVE-2018-9276","https://github.com/BardLaudian/CVE-2018-9276"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-1206.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0076","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0076.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-12998","title":"Zoho ManageEngine Netflow Analyzer 反射型跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"Zoho ManageEngine Netflow Analyzer、Network Configuration Manager、OpManager、OpUtils 及 Firewall Analyzer 等多款产品存在反射型跨站脚本攻击（XSS）漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送包含恶意脚本的请求，将攻击载荷注入到`operation`参数并传递给`/servlet/com.adventnet.me.opmanager.servlet.FailOverHelperServlet`路径，当管理员访问该恶意链接时，脚本会在其浏览器上下文中执行。该漏洞影响 Netflow Analyzer 123137 版本之前、Network Configuration Manager 123128 版本之前、OpManager 123148 版本之前、OpUtils 123161 版本之前以及 Firewall Analyzer 123147 版本之前的全部受影响实例，攻击者可借此窃取会话令牌、执行未经授权的管理操作或篡改页面内容，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级为中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-12998"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-06-29T12:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:38:40Z","remediation":"建议立即升级受影响产品至安全版本：Netflow Analyzer 升级至 build 123137 及以上，Network Configuration Manager 升级至 build 123128 及以上，OpManager 升级至 build 123148 及以上，OpUtils 升级至 build 123161 及以上，Firewall Analyzer 升级至 build 123147 及以上。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器或前端 WAF 中过滤 /servlet/com.adventnet.me.opmanager.servlet.FailOverHelperServlet 路径下 operation 参数中的 &lt;script&gt;、onerror 等恶意字符，或暂时限制该 servlet 的外网访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/148635/Zoho-ManageEngine-13-13790-build-XSS-File-Read-File-Deletion.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2018/Jul/75","http://www.cnnvd.org.cn/web/xxk/ldxqById.tag?CNNVD=CNNVD-201807-036","https://github.com/unh3x/just4cve/issues/10","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-12998.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-12998.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/f5a1370a5c99053077d951ed65ac8cc8cef6e9f7/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-12998.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-12998.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-12998-3270.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-12998-3272.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/14587a553af4d49d5605e1beebb7fda4e5c12c66/cves/2018/12xxx/CVE-2018-12998.json","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-12998.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/ ZOHO ManageEngine Netflow Analyzer/CVE-2018-12998.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2018-12998.js","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2018/CVE-2018-12998.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0076.toml"}]